export anchor WatercolourStyle:
    number: 60
    screen: Calendar
    name: Watercolour
    idea: Events bloom as soft watercolour washes on warm paper, with handwritten headings and no hard lines, so the week feels painted rather than ruled.
    base: light
    palette:
        paper: #fdfbf7, the page, with faint blue, rose and sage blooms in the corners
        ink: #2f3640, text and event titles
        washGrey: #545c68, meta, hour labels and day names
        indigo: #2e4a7a, the primary button, the today ring, checkboxes and focus
        ceruleanWash: #6ea0d2, Team events and the current nav item at 35 to 60 percent
        sageWash: #8cb68c, longer team sessions and the month card
        ochreWash: #e4b860, Deadline events and the brand blot
        lilacWash: #aa96d2, Out of office events and the avatar
        roseWash: #e28c96, the page corner bloom only
        pencilLine: #e8e1d6, faint hour rules
    type:
        Handwritten headings in Segoe Print, Bradley Hand, Chalkboard SE,
        Marker Felt, Comic Sans MS, cursive. Body in a soft humanist sans,
        Avenir Next, Avenir, Segoe UI, Nunito, Ubuntu, system-ui, sans-serif.
        Sizes are 36px hand for the week title, 24px hand day numbers, 20px
        hand panel headings, 13.5px bold event titles, 15px body and 12px meta
        with tabular figures.
    layout:
        A light top row with the handwritten brand on an ochre blot, a text
        nav where the current item sits on a blue wash, and Mara on the right.
        The title row holds the week title and the controls. A 250px left
        column holds the month card on a sage wash, the calendar checkboxes
        and a dotted note about Lena. The main area is a true time grid with a
        52px hour gutter and seven day columns, an all day row, then sixteen
        half hour rows of 44px from 09 to 17 hours. Events sit in their slots
        and grow taller when their text needs it. Below 1100px the side column
        moves under the week, and below 820px the grid becomes an agenda list
        with each day heading followed by its washes.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 6px between day columns, 44px per half hour, 28 to 32px between areas.
    density: Relaxed. The full working day is shown and events are sized by their length.
    corners: Irregular blob radii such as 30 40 36 44 percent, never a perfect circle or rectangle.
    borders: None. Wash edges come from an SVG turbulence displacement filter on the wash layer only, never on text.
    shadows: Only under the primary button and the selected view, soft and pooled below.
    icons:
        Hand-drawn 1.8 stroke line shapes at 13 to 18px. A circle marks Team,
        an hourglass marks Deadline and a crescent marks Out of office, each
        beside its word.
    focus: A 3px indigo outline at 55 percent offset 3px with softly rounded corners. A focused field turns white with a 2px indigo ring.
    tone: Gentle and personal, such as November, week one and A blank page today.
